agent_11 round 4 plan: submit T23 day of week with:
import datetime
def solve(year, month, day):
    return datetime.date(year, month, day).strftime('%A')
Verify with run_tests first (2024-1-1 Monday, 2000-2-29 Tuesday, 1999-12-31 Friday). Then submit. If it fails hidden tests, consider Zeller's congruence instead. T24 stuck at 7/8 on hidden tests - deprioritize. Beware: tasks can lock mid-round (lost T05 to agent_08), so submit as soon as public tests pass.
